Licences for compiler runtime archives copied into the native SDK.

GCC: gcc-mirror/gcc, releases/gcc-14.2.0, COPYING3 and COPYING.RUNTIME.
LLVM: llvm/llvm-project, llvmorg-19.1.7, compiler-rt/LICENSE.TXT.

The selected toolchain determines which archive is installed. Both sets
are retained so an image built with GCC or Clang includes its notices.
